$end_stage
$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("The mechanism $f Imperial $f Intelligence has devised for delivering the $f XX-23 $f Homing $f Beacon falls somewhere below military standards in terms of reliability, so $f Alpha $f 1 will need to be covered closely to ensure that the devices are fully secured.  Once tagged, these ships should not be hindered further, though scans of their cargo may still be of some use to us.", 1486)
$end_multi_text
$voice: l1_M3_b4.ogg
