$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("Other fleeing vessels are to be disabled or destroyed at the wing commander's discretion.  Any ship that poses a danger should be eliminated as quickly as possible to serve as a warning to the others.  With luck, our objectives will be accomplished with minimal bloodshed.  All squadrons will be prepared to launch in fifteen minutes.", 1487)
$end_multi_text
$voice: l1_M3_b5.ogg
